Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:26.81,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}A{\1c&H778D3A&}n{\1c&H6F9B4B&}d{\1c&H66AA5D&} {\1c&H60B56A&}t{\1c&H59C179&}h{\1c&H50D18C&}o{\1c&H48E09E&}s{\1c&H4BE4AB&}e{\1c&H61D8B2&} {\1c&H73CEB9&}d{\1c&H8BC1C0&}a{\1c&HA3B4C8&}y{\1c&HB9A8D0&}s{\1c&HCC9DD6&} {\1c&HE490DE&}w{\1c&HED91D7&}i{\1c&HEE95CF&}l{\1c&HEE98C8&}l{\1c&HEF9EBE&} {\1c&HF0A6AF&}b{\1c&HF1AF9E&}e{\1c&HF2B690&} {\1c&HF3BE80&}h{\1c&HF4C76F&}a{\1c&HE5BE6E&}p{\1c&HCAA57A&}p{\1c&HAF8C86&}y{\1c&H9E7D8D&},{\1c&H8C6C95&} {\1c&H77599E&}t{\1c&H5C41AA&}o{\1c&H4128B6&}o{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:34.40,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}J{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H6D9F50&}s{\1c&H63AF64&}t{\1c&H5BBD75&} {\1c&H53CC87&}w{\1c&H45E4A4&}a{\1c&H59DCB0&}n{\1c&H74CEB9&}n{\1c&H8FBFC2&}a{\1c&HA9B1CA&} {\1c&HC5A1D3&}m{\1c&HE98EDF&}a{\1c&HEE95CF&}k{\1c&HEF9FBC&}e{\1c&HF0A8AB&} {\1c&HF1B199&}y{\1c&HF3BC84&}o{\1c&HF4C771&}u{\1c&HEAC26C&} {\1c&HCAA57A&}h{\1c&HA88689&}a{\1c&H876897&}p{\1c&H6549A6&}p{\1c&H442BB4&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:06.03,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.03,0:21:09.08,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:15.96,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:20.46,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:25.97,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}With the sun shining down its warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:30.68,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And you here by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:35.52,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high {Oh i'm sure of that}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:40.90,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I feel like dashing out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:45.74,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.11,0:21:51.20,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice out to forever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:56.16,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.41,0:22:01.59,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Ride the dancing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:06.67,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:11.89,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice springs up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:13.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.24,Default,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,Well, your dad always picks you up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:20.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi isn't my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:22.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My dad is Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:24.67,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,That's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:27.42,Default,Nao,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone has a mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:30.63,Default,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,So, what's Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:33.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.22,Default,Nao,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:36.52,Default,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,You're so weird, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:36.52,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Men can't have babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:37.31,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:40.06,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need a dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:41.19,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Dummies!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:42.81,Default,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,It takes one to know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:45.19,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Dummy, dummy, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:48.49,Default,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,Ms. Hiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:48.49,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.49,0:00:51.99,Default,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki called me a dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:52.69,Default,Nao,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Kouki kept saying dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:54.58,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Ms. Hiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.37,0:00:59.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, do you only live with your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:03.96,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,My dad went off somewhere, and then they got a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's a "divorce"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:10.96,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's like quitting marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:15.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe my mom is gone because she got a divorce...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:17.18,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't wear your hat, they'll get mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.02,0:01:24.14,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Look, your string is stretched out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:37.66,Default,Nao,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Your dad's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.24,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:39.53,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It's Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:41.12,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,He's here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.03,0:01:43.12,Default,Maa-kun,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Wiin, pibbup!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.63,0:01:48.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:01:59.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:01.81,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:03.35,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.35,0:02:04.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you feel like having for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:06.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Um, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:08.77,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:11.90,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom's here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:48.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom's beautiful, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:52.01,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,More like a noisy old bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:56.26,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:59.60,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, Rin always looks after Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:01.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:06.19,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,My son can be a little abrasive, so he's had trouble making friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.27,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:10.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! Not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:11.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I-I should be thanking you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My Rin is incredibly unsociable...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.99,0:04:16.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's like birds of a feather flock together, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:20.87,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! You were just talking about me, weren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:22.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't saying anything bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:24.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now, walk faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:25.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't beg me to carry you home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I won't beg!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:28.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:33.76,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Is Rin a "Daddy's girl"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm not her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm more like a relative, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:41.01,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry, what was I thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:42.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.31,0:04:43.77,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, you're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:51.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice that you made a friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:52.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:57.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki said that he doesn't have a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:01.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He said his dad went somewhere after the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:04.70,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin... Do you know what divorce is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. When marriage is finished, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:10.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, more or less...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:14.88,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If God finds out, He punishes them, doesn't He?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.59,0:05:17.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:23.06,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if my mom is gone because of divorce too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:28.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to meet her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:31.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:35.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:41.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:45.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If she's like Kouki's mom, I think I would like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:53.09,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.09,0:05:55.05,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's mother is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:06:00.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Grandpa's maid is probably Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:01.84,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:05.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Have you heard anything about the maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:08.10,Default,Kurohige,0000,0000,0000,,This was pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:09.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A farewell party? For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.47,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry it took so long to set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:13.81,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Winter sales have finally settled down, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:14.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:17.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't really go out at night, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:18.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I have a six year old at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:22.57,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Are you telling me you haven't even gone out once?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:25.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:29.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even think about going drinking anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:30.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'm just getting old...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:31.62,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,You're only thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:34.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the people in my shipping department are young,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:35.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but a lot of them have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:37.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We don't normally go drinking anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:38.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.34,Default,Kurohige,0000,0000,0000,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.18,Default,Kurohige,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta pick up the kid from kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:45.05,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,We had two kids in two years and the youngest is 3 months old,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:46.85,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,so if I don't get home quick, my wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:49.35,Default,Curly Hair,0000,0000,0000,,Turns into "Wifezilla", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:51.56,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,Monsters are nothing compared to when she's mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:06:57.15,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:06:58.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Gotou!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.78,0:07:01.45,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I heard about the farewell party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:04.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but I can't go out at night, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:06.28,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,They went to the trouble of arranging it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:07.41,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,so why don't you bring the kid along?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:09.66,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:12.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You want to go drinking once in a while too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:14.46,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,No worries, it'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.21,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:19.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'm coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:21.42,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:24.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:31.14,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi? It seems Grandpa had a maid from some agency...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:32.85,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, whoa, wait a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:34.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:37.47,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshii Masako, spelled with the characters for "correct" and "child".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:42.15,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's the name on the maternal health record, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:43.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I believe so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:45.78,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to contact her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:48.70,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,She abandoned that precious child...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:50.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:52.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You saw the health record, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.33,0:07:54.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's a lot written in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's so much that we still don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:02.58,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:03.71,Default,Drunk,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}What I'm saying is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:07.96,Default,Drunk,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I don't know the difference between work and home anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:07.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:11.14,Default,Drunk,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, slacker! C'mere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Get away from me, you drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:16.19,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin? You came!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:17.77,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:20.11,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You're so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:26.86,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Eat all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.45,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:30.70,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you're here, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:31.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:34.04,Default,Female Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Here you are, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:35.87,Default,Female Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Is orange juice okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:36.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mm-hm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.21,Default,Good-looking Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's beautiful, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:40.59,Default,Female Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, she sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:41.71,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You're embarrassing her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.76,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yuu, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:51.89,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:56.56,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi, don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:59.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin might sleep on the way home, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:02.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'm going to the washroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"Bathroom"!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:06.70,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah, "bathroom".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:11.37,Default,Male Employee A,0000,0000,0000,,He left our section high and dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.37,0:09:14.75,Default,Male Employee B,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't produce results, and then bail!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:16.54,Default,Male Employee B,0000,0000,0000,,Quitting while you're ahead is dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:18.75,Default,Male Employee A,0000,0000,0000,,Sales have been tough this month...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:19.75,Default,Male Employee A,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we do a decent job selling,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.75,0:09:22.29,Default,Male Employee A,0000,0000,0000,,management won't look at anything but last year's results!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:23.75,Default,Male Employee B,0000,0000,0000,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:26.09,Default,Male Employee,0000,0000,0000,,This sucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:30.54,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The old me would've stormed in and ripped them a new one, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:32.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I really need to pee.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:35.64,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Girls are so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:38.56,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna take {\i1}you{\i0} home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:43.56,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What's important to me has changed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:44.98,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.95,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,About your transfer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:53.66,Default,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,After seeing Rin, I've come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:09:57.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:59.36,Default,Yuu,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:00.16,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna hold her forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:01.66,Default,Yuu,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Pick me up, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:03.04,Default,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou, Rin doesn't wanna be held!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.05,0:10:06.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:10.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What were you thinking when you left her behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:14.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yuu was really cute, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:17.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You sure do love little kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.31,0:10:19.10,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep! The mail came.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:20.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:26.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,An elementary school admission information session, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.07,0:10:28.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even have to do any research this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:30.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:35.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is there an admissions test?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.62,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:39.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can get in without taking a test!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:39.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:41.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Compulsory education is just that awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:49.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're {\i1}so{\i0} drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:52.83,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot! How's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:58.14,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, he's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.39,0:11:00.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,S-sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.73,0:11:04.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone else already left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:06.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:09.57,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, your mother's here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:12.99,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.99,0:11:14.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:17.49,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's been... a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:20.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, are we gonna make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:23.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll grab a taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:24.96,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:30.63,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Name tags can be turned around,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:34.84,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,and they {\i1}must{\i0} be turned on the way home from school, so that their names aren't visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:38.68,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,You must also tell your child not to be alone at a park.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:41.73,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,And don't forget to tell them not to follow strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:43.69,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.69,0:11:45.65,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of teaching them to trust people,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:48.32,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,we have to teach them to be suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:49.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:53.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That one sheet we were given...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:54.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.16,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll carry them! I've got them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:59.62,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know what vaccinations they've had?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:04.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:07.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I should know this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:08.46,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:11.09,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have Rin's health record?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:13.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, at home...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:15.55,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Maternal Health Record
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:15.97,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It has a vaccination record page.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:17.26,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Now you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.97,0:12:20.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:24.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I really don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:27.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See, I just met Rin about three months ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:30.23,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Three months?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.23,0:12:31.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:34.24,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:38.62,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, Rin looks like she really trusts you, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:41.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:44.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,At home, she's really sassy and noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:48.00,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's proof she trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:52.30,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's obvious that she sees you as family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:54.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Family...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:58.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:12:59.51,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:03.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:12.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I just jumped over your shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:22.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:23.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:27.25,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:28.92,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:30.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:36.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:38.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She has almost everything on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:41.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Bookbag?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:42.10,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:43.47,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you'd better!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:46.52,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,All the designer label and cute ones are sold out by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:48.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A normal one is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:51.06,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She's a girl, so "normal" won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:53.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I'll look this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:58.03,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai, are you going to really raise Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:02.66,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After all, you transferred to another section, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:05.70,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't really thought ahead that far...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:06.50,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:09.37,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Now I'll do your hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:10.46,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:13.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You two are close, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:18.59,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Mothers and daughters are like friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:29.06,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it, Mom and Kazumi are like buddies too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:31.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Who's to say that Masako's situation hasn't changed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:34.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and she wants Rin back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:42.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look at how many shots she's had...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:44.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother must have...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:50.07,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7}Souichi's Will
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:50.07,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Boing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:51.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A will!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.12,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Boing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:56.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"If Masako found it, she would probably get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:15:01.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thus, I've taken this... roundabout method.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:06.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,However, I don't really know the proper way to write a secret... riddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:09.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And this "keyboard" thing is making a fool out of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:12.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so I can't proceed at but a snail's pace."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, these character conversion mistakes are dreadful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:18.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Already, this feeble-minded old fool's energy is exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:20.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Therefore, I'm giving up on this blog..."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:22.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to the "greatest generation"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.95,0:15:26.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"To be continued in Rin's maternal health record..."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:33.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:34.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let me have a look-see here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:47.10,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,Since I'm guessing that the person who will find this piece of paper loves Rin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:50.93,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,I shall give an account here of Rin and her mother, Masako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.07,0:16:01.69,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako is easily misunderstood,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:05.45,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,so I would like to start by saying that she is by no means a bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:09.69,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,She knows that she's a failure of a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:11.41,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,She feels sorry for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:18.04,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even now, she persists on being my maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:20.71,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,I believe that she will continue to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:24.43,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think of that as Rin's greatest happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:27.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Happy? What does he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:34.69,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's living a vigilant life, carefully leaving no traces of herself behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:36.19,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,so that if something should happen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:39.06,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,her existence will be hidden from all of my relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:43.03,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako certainly has a mother's love for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.49,0:16:51.08,Default,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)}But she's still young and may not yet have the maturity to be a parent...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:55.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really understand it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.71,0:17:02.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But the one thing that's clear is that he cared about Rin and her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:05.79,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1500)\frz21.904\pos(623,299)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:12.26,cell,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(642,376)\frz2.888}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.43,0:17:14.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:17.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:18.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:23.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to make my hair look like rabbit ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.03,0:17:23.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:27.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Like what Reina's mom did before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.78,0:17:28.70,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:29.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:31.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I can do it! It's outta my league!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:36.00,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You {\i1}will{\i0} do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:37.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,'Cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:40.67,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,she said I wasn't cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:41.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:43.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Someone said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:48.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mii said I wasn't cute at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.93,0:17:49.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:53.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think you win, hands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:57.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna be cute, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:07.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's already grown to be a fine girl
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.78,0:18:09.86,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and that means her feelings can definitely be hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:12.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako, did you know...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:16.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's mind has already developed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.37,0:18:19.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's mature in a lot of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:22.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's why she needs an adult to keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fin...ished!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:33.39,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:45.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\i1}Twinkle, twinkle, little star...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:47.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\i1}How I wonder what you...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:47.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:51.28,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a secret, so I can't tell anyone at home about Parents' Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:53.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What? Parents' Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:55.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You can't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:59.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}S-She's gonna do it with that hairstyle?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:05.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\i1}Twinkle, twinkle, little star,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:07.91,cell,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(643,397)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:10.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\i1}How I wonder what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:10.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you left Rin alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:15.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,thinking she'd eventually forget something as painful as that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:15.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\i1}Up above the world so high,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:19.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\i1}Like a diamond in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I have no problems with hating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:22.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You better at least have a damn good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:23.89,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\i1}Twinkle, twinkle, little star,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:28.52,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\i1}How I wonder what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:24.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:32.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,what could possibly be a good reason for abandoning a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:35.82,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx56.25\fscy45\pos(625,352)\frz347.914\frx338\fry346}Study desk
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:35.82,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz347.914\fscx38.75\fscy33.75\pos(696,507)\frx340\fry338}Study chair
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:35.82,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.12,0:19:37.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well yeah, it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:41.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But you're going to be using it for a long time, so we want something a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:43.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.17,0:19:45.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A desk that looks like it's for a young lady would be better, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:47.17,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:51.88,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! One that's for a young lady is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.93,0:19:53.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:56.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're sitting there again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:58.35,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I look like a young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:00.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. And I think you can still use the desk
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.31,0:20:02.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,when you're a high school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:04.56,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is a high school student an adult?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.15,0:20:08.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that's half an adult...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:13.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me read!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:19.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"A girl went alone into a forest to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:26.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She lost her way and looked for the path to get back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:28.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,but she just couldn't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.21,0:20:34.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Suddenly, before she knew it, there was a tiny house in the forest."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.44,0:20:51.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is this Yoshii?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.57,0:20:53.90,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:28.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is cute, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.08,0:22:30.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Again?! Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:32.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:33.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:37.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.72,0:22:40.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you not to run off on your own like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.09,0:22:41.39,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.43,0:22:43.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:46.10,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It can make me into a young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:49.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.64,0:22:51.10,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is for much later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.77,0:22:53.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
